            <div xml:id="d803">

                <pb facs="0957" n="945" sameAs="frus:frus1943v03/pg945"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.0090/3248: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Harrison</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bern</hi></placeName>, [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1943-11-23T19:00:00-04:00"
                            notBefore="1943-11-22T00:00:00+01:00">undated</date>].<lb/>[Received
                        November 23, 1943—7:28 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>7389. American interests Far East repatriation. Department’s 2726, November 5.
                    Swiss note November 22 states Gorgé submitted question third exchange [to]
                    Japanese Foreign Office spokesman. <pb facs="0958" n="946" xml:id="pg946"/>
                    Gorgé telegraphs that his informant, while declaring inability make commitment,
                    directed his attention to fact that possibility third exchange could not be
                    given consideration before clarification certain points concerning treatment
                    Japanese citizens interned United States. Spokesman added that Spanish
                    representative requested undertake Investigation nature of which American
                    Government is informed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Harrison</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
